msgstr "Video"

#: assets/js/studio-builder-sketch.js:88
msgid "e.g. Our 30-second tour teaser"
msgstr "z. B. Unser 30-Sekunden-Teaser zur Tour"

#: assets/js/studio-builder-sketch.js:89
